# 402 Agent for Pump.fun Deployment (Solana Native)

A **payment-gated API service** that enables AI agents to deploy tokens on Pump.fun using the **HTTP 402 (Payment Required)** standard with **native Solana (SOL/USDC)** payments.

---

## Overview

This agent implements the **402 payment protocol** with Solana blockchain payments, allowing AI agents and automated systems to programmatically deploy tokens on Pump.fun by paying per request in SOL or USDC.
The service acts as a bridge between **payment verification** and **Pump.fun’s deployment API**.

---

## Features

* **402 Payment Protocol** – Standard HTTP 402 response with Solana payment address
* **Native Solana Payments** – SOL and SPL token (USDC) support
* **Pump.fun Integration** – Direct token deployment to Solana via Pump.fun
* **Agent-Friendly API** – RESTful endpoints designed for AI agent consumption
* **Real-time Payment Verification** – WebSocket monitoring of Solana transactions
* **Escrow Protection** – Optional escrow for failed deployments
* **Rate Limiting** – Configurable limits per payment tier
* **Webhook Support** – Real-time deployment status updates

---

## Architecture

```text
┌─────────────┐    402 Request      ┌──────────────┐
│  AI Agent   │ ──────────────────> │  402 Agent   │
│   Wallet    │                     │   Service    │
│             │ <────────────────── │              │
└──────┬──────┘  Payment Address    └──────┬───────┘
       │                                    │
       │  Send SOL/USDC                     │ Monitor
       │                                    │ Payment
       v                                    v
┌─────────────┐                      ┌──────────────┐
│   Solana    │ ──────────────────> │   Pump.fun   │
│ Blockchain  │   Deploy Token       │     API      │
└─────────────┘                      └──────────────┘
```

---

## Installation

### Prerequisites

* Node.js 18+
* Solana wallet with SOL for gas fees
* Solana RPC endpoint (Helius, QuickNode, or self-hosted)
* Pump.fun API access
* PostgreSQL or MongoDB for payment tracking

---

### Setup

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/pumpfun-402-solana-agent.git
cd pumpfun-402-solana-agent

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Copy environment template
cp .env.example .env

# Configure your environment variables
nano .env
```

---

### Environment Variables

```env
# Solana Configuration
SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
SOLANA_RPC_WS_URL=wss://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
PAYMENT_WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY=your_base58_private_key
DEPLOYMENT_WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY=your_deployment_private_key

# Pump.fun Configuration
PUMPFUN_API_URL=https://pumpportal.fun/api
PUMPFUN_PRIVATE_KEY=your_pumpfun_private_key

# Payment Configuration
PRICE_PER_DEPLOYMENT_SOL=0.01 # SOL
PRICE_PER_DEPLOYMENT_USDC=1.5 # USDC
USDC_MINT_ADDRESS=EPjFWdd5AufqSSqeM2qN1xzybapC8G4wEGGkZwyTDt1v
PAYMENT_TIMEOUT=300 # seconds
PAYMENT_CONFIRMATION_BLOCKS=1

# Service Configuration
PORT=3402
NODE_ENV=production
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/pumpfun402

# Security
API_KEY_SALT=random_salt_for_api_keys
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_webhook_secret
MAX_REQUESTS_PER_HOUR=100

# Optional Escrow
ENABLE_ESCROW=true
ESCROW_PROGRAM_ID=your_escrow_program_id
```

---

## API Documentation

### 1. Initiate Token Deployment

**POST** `/api/v1/deploy/token`
Initiates a token deployment request. Returns `402` with Solana payment address.

**Request Body:**

```json
{
  "tokenName": "MyToken",
  "tokenSymbol": "MTK",
  "description": "A token deployed by an AI agent",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/token-image.png",
  "twitter": "https://twitter.com/mytoken",
  "telegram": "https://t.me/mytoken",
  "website": "https://mytoken.com",
  "initialBuyAmount": 0.1,
  "slippageBps": 500,
  "priorityFee": 0.0001,
  "paymentToken": "SOL",
  "webhookUrl": "https://your-agent.com/webhook",
  "agentWallet": "YourAgentWalletAddress..."
}
```

**Response (402):**

```json
{
  "status": 402,
  "message": "Payment Required",
  "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz",
  "payment": {
    "address": "7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU",
    "amount": 0.01,
    "token": "SOL",
    "amountLamports": 10000000,
    "memo": "PUMPFUN_DEPLOY_dep_abc123xyz",
    "expiresAt": "2025-10-28T15:30:00Z",
    "qrCode": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...",
    "deepLink": "solana:7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU?amount=0.01&memo=PUMPFUN_DEPLOY_dep_abc123xyz"
  },
  "verifyUrl": "/api/v1/deploy/verify/dep_abc123xyz",
  "wsUrl": "wss://api.yourservice.com/ws/payment/dep_abc123xyz"
}
```

---

### 2. Verify Payment & Execute

**GET** `/api/v1/deploy/verify/{deploymentId}`
Checks payment status and executes deployment if paid.

**Response (200 – Paid):**

```json
{
  "status": "executing",
  "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz",
  "paid": true,
  "paidAt": "2025-10-28T15:25:00Z",
  "paymentSignature": "5wHu8W5N4KqgZz3nP8K...",
  "paymentAmount": 0.01,
  "deployment": {
    "status": "processing",
    "estimatedCompletion": "2025-10-28T15:26:00Z"
  }
}
```

**Response (402 – Unpaid):**

```json
{
  "status": "pending_payment",
  "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz",
  "paid": false,
  "payment": {
    "address": "7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU",
    "amount": 0.01,
    "token": "SOL",
    "expiresAt": "2025-10-28T15:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

---

### 3. Get Deployment Status

**GET** `/api/v1/deploy/status/{deploymentId}`

**Response:**

```json
{
  "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz",
  "status": "completed",
  "tokenAddress": "7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU",
  "signature": "5wHu8W5N4KqgZz3nP8K...",
  "paymentSignature": "3nP8K5wHu8W5N4KqgZz...",
  "marketCap": 50000,
  "bondingCurveProgress": 15.5,
  "createdAt": "2025-10-28T15:26:00Z",
  "links": {
    "pumpfun": "https://pump.fun/7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU",
    "solscan": "https://solscan.io/token/7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU",
    "dexscreener": "https://dexscreener.com/solana/7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU"
  }
}
```

---

### 4. WebSocket Payment Monitoring

**WS** `wss://api.yourservice.com/ws/payment/{deploymentId}`

Real-time payment status updates.

**Messages:**

```json
{ "type": "payment_detected", "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz", "signature": "5wHu8W5N4KqgZz3nP8K...", "amount": 0.01, "confirmations": 1 }
{ "type": "payment_confirmed", "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz", "signature": "5wHu8W5N4KqgZz3nP8K...", "confirmations": 32 }
{ "type": "deployment_started", "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz" }
{ "type": "deployment_completed", "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz", "tokenAddress": "7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU" }
```

