## Pricing Tiers

| Tier         | Price (SOL) | Price (USDC) | Features                  |
| ------------ | ----------- | ------------ | ------------------------- |
| **Basic**    | 0.01        | $1.50        | Standard deployment       |
| **Priority** | 0.05        | $7.50        | Priority + higher compute |
| **Premium**  | 0.1         | $15.00       | Expedited + analytics     |

