---

## Error Handling

| Error                  | Cause                | Solution                        |
| ---------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| `PAYMENT_TIMEOUT`      | Payment not received | Resend with higher priority fee |
| `INSUFFICIENT_PAYMENT` | Wrong amount sent    | Send exact amount specified     |
| `INVALID_MEMO`         | Missing/wrong memo   | Include deployment ID in memo   |
| `DEPLOYMENT_FAILED`    | Pump.fun error       | Automatic refund initiated      |

